        "date": "2026-11-08T01:48:36Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): spindle speed editable on the Feeds tab, as rpm or surface speed\n\nThe Feeds tab's Cutting data group gets an editable Spindle speed row\nwith an rpm / surface switch (m/min in a mm document, SFM in an inch\none, through the tool's diameter). The speed is the op tool's, so a\ncommitted value is one undoable ChangeTool - on drag release or Enter,\nnever per frame - and the hover says it edits the tool for every\noperation using it.\n\nFixes #225\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
