      "message": "fix(ui): name the tool diameter when surface speed has none; hold to spindle_max\n\nA zero tool diameter in surface mode said the speed must be above zero;\nit now says the tool diameter must be above zero to show or set surface\nspeed. A committed speed over the machine's stated spindle_max is held to\nit with a status note, and the row's hover names the machine maximum.\n\nRefs #225\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
